title: A commit shown while the diff of the working tree is on, then split and unfolded, another commit, then commit off and diff off: the working tree's own diff comes back first, then every card is plain text
folders: git-history
forbid-log: script: ignoring
forbid-log: commit needs off

wait 3000
left changes
touch src/util.rs // changed in the working tree
wait 2500
diff on
wait 1500
goto src/util.rs
wait 1200
mark 1-worktree-diff
wait 500
commit 5
wait 1800
mark 2-commit-a-label
wait 500
diff split
wait 1500
mark 3-commit-split
wait 500
diff unfold
wait 1500
mark 4-commit-split-unfold
wait 500
commit 4
wait 1800
mark 5-other-commit-split-unfold
wait 500
diff together
diff fold
commit off
wait 1800
goto src/util.rs
wait 1200
mark 6-commit-off-worktree-diff
wait 500
diff off
wait 1500
fit
wait 1200
mark 7-all-off
wait 500
quit
